source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: Image parameters are comma-separated inside the same cell.
-- input.jira --
||h1||h2||
|!http://x/i.png|alt=alt, width=10!|c|
-- rendered.html --
<div class='table-wrap'>
<table class='confluenceTable'><tbody>
<tr>
<th class='confluenceTh'>h1</th>
<th class='confluenceTh'>h2</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="http://x/i.png" alt="alt" width="10" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>c</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
</div>
-- want.md --
:::table
||h1||h2||
|!http://x/i.png|alt=alt, width=10!|c|
:::
